OL,3,GNEWSAHumber swim postponed after rescue
OL,4,Acallouts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity swim across the Humber was
OL,7,Fpostponed after volunteers, who were
OL,8,Fdue to provide safety cover, spent 12
OL,9,Fhours responding to "long and
OL,10,Fchallenging incidents" in the estuary.
OL,12,FHumber Rescue said it was called out to
OL,13,Fthree incidents in 24 hours and,
OL,14,Falthough volunteers did offer to
OL,15,Fcontinue to cover the Humber Swim, a
OL,16,Fdecision was made to postpone it on
OL,17,Fsafety grounds.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
