OL,3,GNEWSAHumber swim postponed after rescue
OL,4,Acallouts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event on Sunday was due to be the
OL,7,Flast organised by Sarah Scholes, who
OL,8,Fstarted the Humber Swim 12 years ago
OL,9,Fand has raised more than #130,000 for
OL,10,Fthe rescue service.
OL,12,FScholes said it was "disappointing but
OL,13,Ftotally understandable" and the event
OL,14,Fhad been rescheduled for 6 September.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
